## 🚨 CRITICAL: Mandatory Session Protocol

Every session in Windsurf MUST follow the same protocol described in `CLAUDE.md`.

**Why this exists:** Cascade reads instructions but will not follow them unless confirmations are requested explicitly.

**How it works:**

1. Copy-paste the starter prompt at session start.
2. Cascade must complete and confirm all six protocol steps (including Step 4.5 Verification Gate).
3. Missing confirmation = workflow violation (call it out immediately).

**📋 Full Protocol:** `.agent/MANDATORY_SESSION_PROTOCOL.md`  
**🚀 Quick Start Guide:** `SESSION_START_QUICK_GUIDE.md`

